WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.725
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind uses of output devices.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:10.757
Monitor: displays visual output. Printer: makes output on paper.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:16.413
Speaker: produces audio output. Projector: shows images to a group. Headphones:

00:00:16.413 --> 00:00:18.593
provide sound for one listener.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:24.582
In a small group, draw or safely examine pictures of monitor, printer and speaker.

00:00:24.582 --> 00:00:27.514
Explain one real-life use for each in Ghana.
